{"title":"Anvil/21","sourceTitle":"Anvil/21/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><ol><li>Crie um molde de bigorna através de <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Clay_forming\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Clay forming\">clay forming</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Clay_forming\" title=\"Clay forming\"> </a></span> e queime-o em <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Pit_kiln\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Pit kiln\">pit kiln</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Pit_kiln\" title=\"Pit kiln\"> </a></span> ou <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Beehive_kiln\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Beehive kiln\">beehive kiln</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Beehive_kiln\" title=\"Beehive kiln\"> </a></span>.</li>\n<li>Fundir 900 unidades de metal (equivalente a 9 <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Ingot\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Ingot\">ingots</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Ingot\" title=\"Ingot\"> </a></span>) em um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Crucible\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Crucible\">crucible</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Crucible\" title=\"Crucible\"> </a></span> usando um <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Fuel#High_temperature_fuels\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Fuel\">high-temperature fuel</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Fuel#High_temperature_fuels\" title=\"Fuel\"> </a></span>.</li>\n<li>Despeje o metal fundido no molde da bigorna até que esteja cheio.</li>\n<li>Depois de esfriar, quebre o molde da bigorna para recuperá-la.</li></ol>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115611\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 127/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 934/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 422/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\